abstract: "Interactive intelligent tutoring system built with CMU Cognitive Tutor Authoring Tools (CTAT) and an optional AI digital-twin sidebar, teaching students to diagnose bipedal humanoid robot forward/backward falls from ROS IMU pitch angles and verify safe standing recovery."
